内部额外电流仍待核实。\", \"扫描频率未知：不使用串行通信时钟替代，不能据此判定纹波频谱或稳态滤波效果。\", \"缺少目标平均电流/亮度，电流上限不能决定唯一阻值。\"]" (at 80.01 127.0 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (instances (project "Circuit" (path "/56fc9562-12f4-4c83-a4c7-f52e38988438" (reference "R1") (unit 1))))) (symbol (lib_id "Device:R") (at 80.01 132.08 270.0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "d3aa2d18-1b64-4591-a4eb-346f1373a243") (property "Reference" "R2" (at 72.63 133.596 90.0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))) (property "Value" "330Ω" (at 83.566 133.596 90.0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))) (property "Footprint" "Resistor_SMD:R_0805_2012Metric" (at 78.232 132.08 90) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 80.01 132.08 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "Resistor" (at 80.01 132.08 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "" (at 80.01 132.08 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (property "DesignId" "R2" (at 80.01 132.08 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (property "SelectionStatus" "provisional" (at 80.01 132.08 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (property "SelectionBasis" "现值为候选；条件计算不能唯一确定选型。" (at 80.01 132.08 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (property "SelectionMissing" "[\"DS1.forwardVoltage: 模块 Vf 未给出，按红色 LED 段 2.0V 候选\", \"DS1.driverDrop: TM1616 开漏导通压降按 0.3V 候选，非全工作区间固定压降\", \"DS1.duty: GRID4 空置仍按 1/4 扫描占空比假设，待固件确认\", \"DS1.maxPeakCurrent: 引文数值已匹配，额定类型（典型/保证范围/绝对最大值）及适用工作条件仍须核实。\", \"DS1.maxGroupCurrent: 引文数值已匹配，额定类型（典型/保证范围/绝对最大值）及适用工作条件仍须核实。\", \"DS1.scanSlots: TM1616 按 GRID1–GRID4 四槽扫描，GRID4 未接仍占一个槽位；待固件确认\", \"扫描电流上界假设电源不超过声明电压、负载及驱动压降非负；缺少压降下界时按 0 V，不能把典型值/单点测试电压作为保证下界。\", \"按一次只使能一个公共端、每个已连接公共端